    "name": "PATIO7 Hotel",
    "detail": "My first time staying in a location hotel for a staycation, worth it. 5 mins walk from MTR station, I reached the hotel and went to check in. Big window makes the room very bright. Also in fact the lighting also make the room bright and feel more spacious. The water form shower was strong, very good. Mini bar is free, with some drink and snacks, super loved it. There is all-day detox water and candies on the lobby, which is also equipped with nice chairs and tables that also a public space. Location: 5 mins to MTR station, 10 mins ride to Garosu-gil, and many bus options to everywhere. Very convenient. Here, you get a very opened view, nicely decorated room at a much cheaper rate than in other areas in gangnam.",
